# Feature Slice Development

Every AI task must be a small feature slice.

- One task handles one feature.
- One task modifies at most one page.
- One task affects one business module.
- One task must be independently testable and reversible.
- Do not generate multiple business modules in one task.

Before editing, output the feature slice plan.
